WEBVTT

00:00:04.278 --> 00:00:05.732
Light's changing.

00:00:06.365 --> 00:00:07.459
On it.

00:00:15.339 --> 00:00:16.718
Highlights first.

00:00:16.122 --> 00:00:17.445
Faces next.

00:00:17.322 --> 00:00:18.077
Done.

00:00:23.061 --> 00:00:24.259
Want it back?

00:00:24.104 --> 00:00:25.331
One key.

00:00:25.226 --> 00:00:26.120
Stopped.

00:00:26.243 --> 00:00:27.414
It's yours.

00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:30.903
Exposure… handled.
